{%- liquid
  assign all_locations = shop.metaobjects.store_location.values
  assign all_tags = shop.metaobjects.store_tag.values
  assign content_width = 'var(--max-width--body-normal)'

  if section.settings.content_width == 'narrow'
    assign content_width = 'var(--max-width--body-narrow)'
  elsif section.settings.content_width == 'full'
    assign content_width = '100%'
  endif

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, text_color: section.settings.text_color, section_id: section.id
  endif

  comment
    Which panel the server renders open.

    The production store finder (`sections/ona-store-finder.liquid` on theme
    160815546559) serves `data-view="map"` with the Map toggle already active,
    and that is the behaviour ONA expects. Rendering the list and letting the
    script switch is a visible flip on the one setting that exists to avoid it.

    Codex raised two objections to doing this on PR #191. Both were right about
    THIS section as it stood, and both are now fixed at the source rather than
    by giving up the setting:

      1. setView('map') reset to list before awaiting the Maps API. The script
         now seeds activeView from this attribute and only resets when it is
         not already showing the map, so the served state is left alone.
      2. The max-width:990px rule hid the list panel in map view, so a page
         whose script never ran would show an empty grey box and no locations.
         The list is no longer hidden at any width -- on narrow screens the map
         sits above it, which is what production does too.

    The map is still only opened when a Maps JavaScript API key is configured.
    Without one the script falls back to the list and posts `no_map_key_status`,
    so serving an open map panel would be an empty box either way.

    The key itself comes from the shop metafield custom.google_maps_api_key,
    falling back to the section setting. It used to live only in the section
    setting, which the theme editor writes into templates/page.location.json --
    a file the GitHub integration overwrites on merge. That wiped the key twice
    on 2026-10-19 and the map went dark both times with nothing reporting it. A
    shop metafield is store data: no merge, theme push or publish touches it.
  endcomment
  assign maps_api_key = shop.metafields.custom.google_maps_api_key.value | default: section.settings.maps_api_key | strip

  assign initial_view = 'list'
  if section.settings.default_view == 'map' and maps_api_key != blank
    assign initial_view = 'map'
  endif
-%}

<script src="{{ 'locations-store-finder.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>

<div
  class="section-background{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
></div>

{%- comment -%}
  Editor-only. The failure this catches is silent by construction: with
  `default_view: map` and no key, assets/locations-store-finder.js falls back to
  the list and posts `no_map_key_status`, which reads like ordinary copy. The
  page looks finished. It looked finished for six weeks after PR #120, because
  supplying the key was a documented handover step with no owner
  (docs/locations-metaobject-migration.md).

  Only the contradiction is flagged -- `default_view: list` with no key is a
  deliberate configuration, not a mistake. `request.design_mode` keeps this out
  of the storefront entirely.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.design_mode and section.settings.default_view == 'map' and maps_api_key == blank -%}
  <div class="locations-store-finder__editor-notice" role="status">
    <strong>The map is switched off.</strong>
    “Default view” is set to Map, but no Google Maps API key is set, so this page
    serves the location list instead. Set it in
    <strong>Settings → Custom data → Shop → Google Maps API key</strong>, where a
    theme merge cannot wipe it. The field below this one still works, but the
    theme editor writes it into this page’s template file, which the GitHub
    integration overwrites — see <code>docs/branching-and-release.md</code> §5.
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{%- paginate all_locations by 250 -%}
  <locations-store-finder
    class="locations-store-finder section section--page-width spacing-style{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
    style="
      --locations-finder-content-width: {{ content_width }};
      --locations-finder-text-color: {{ section.settings.text_color | default: 'var(--color-foreground)' }};
      --locations-finder-accent-color: {{ section.settings.accent_color | default: '#6b1835' }};
      --locations-finder-card-color: {{ section.settings.card_background_color | default: '#ffffff' }};
      {% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}
    "
    data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
    data-current-page="{{ paginate.current_page }}"
    data-next-page-url="{{ paginate.next.url | escape }}"
    data-marker-icon="{{ 'map-active.svg' | asset_url }}"
    data-active-view="{{ initial_view }}"
    {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <div class="locations-store-finder__inner">
      <div class="locations-store-finder__heading-group">
        <h2 class="locations-store-finder__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Find a store' | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
          <div class="locations-store-finder__intro rte">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="locations-store-finder__controls">
        <div class="locations-store-finder__field locations-store-finder__field--search">
          <label for="LocationsFinder-search-{{ section.id }}">
            {{- section.settings.search_label | default: 'Search by store, suburb or address' | escape -}}
          </label>
          <input
            id="LocationsFinder-search-{{ section.id }}"
            type="search"
            placeholder="{{ section.settings.search_placeholder | default: 'Start typing a location' | escape }}"
            autocomplete="street-address"
            data-location-search
          >
        </div>

        {%- if section.settings.enable_radius_filter -%}
          <div class="locations-store-finder__field">
            <label for="LocationsFinder-radius-{{ section.id }}">
              {{- section.settings.radius_label | default: 'Distance' | escape -}}
            </label>
            <select id="LocationsFinder-radius-{{ section.id }}" data-radius-filter>
              <option value="10"{% if section.settings.default_radius == '10' %} selected{% endif %}>10 km</option>
              <option value="25"{% if section.settings.default_radius == '25' %} selected{% endif %}>25 km</option>
              <option value="50"{% if section.settings.default_radius == '50' %} selected{% endif %}>50 km</option>
              <option value="100"{% if section.settings.default_radius == '100' %} selected{% endif %}>100 km</option>
              <option value="250"{% if section.settings.default_radius == '250' %} selected{% endif %}>250 km</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <button class="locations-store-finder__location-button button" type="button" data-use-location>
          {{- section.settings.use_location_label | default: 'Use my location' | escape -}}
        </button>

        <button class="locations-store-finder__reset-button" type="button" data-reset-filters hidden>
          {{- section.settings.reset_label | default: 'Clear filters' | escape -}}
        </button>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Venue type and state are single-choice filters, so they are radio
        groups: one tap instead of a select's open-scan-tap, keyboard arrows
        for free, and every option visible at once. Production renders the same
        two filters this way. The radios are real inputs, with the pill and tab
        styling on the label, so the controls themselves need no JavaScript.

        The venue choices are server-rendered from shop.metaobjects.store_tag,
        so that filter is fully operable without script. The state group ships
        only its "All states" radio and is filled by populateStateFilter from
        the loaded records, so without script it stays a single pill. That is
        no worse than the empty <select> it replaced, and the status line says
        so, but do not mistake it for a no-JavaScript filter.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.enable_tag_filter -%}
        <fieldset
          class="locations-store-finder__choice-group"
          data-tag-filter
          data-choice-name="LocationsFinder-tag-{{ section.id }}"
        >
          <legend>{{ section.settings.tag_label | default: 'Venue type' | escape }}</legend>
          <div class="locations-store-finder__choices locations-store-finder__choices--pills" data-choice-options>
            <label class="locations-store-finder__choice">
              <input type="radio" name="LocationsFinder-tag-{{ section.id }}" value="" checked>
              <span>{{ section.settings.all_tags_label | default: 'All venues' | escape }}</span>
            </label>
            {%- for tag in shop.metaobjects.store_tag.values -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign tag_label = tag.label.value | default: tag.label
                assign tag_slug = tag.slug.value | default: tag.slug | default: tag_label | handleize
              -%}
              <label class="locations-store-finder__choice">
                <input type="radio" name="LocationsFinder-tag-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ tag_slug | escape }}">
                <span>{{ tag_label | escape }}</span>
              </label>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.enable_state_filter -%}
        <fieldset
          class="locations-store-finder__choice-group"
          data-state-filter
          data-choice-name="LocationsFinder-state-{{ section.id }}"
        >
          <legend>{{ section.settings.state_label | default: 'State or territory' | escape }}</legend>
          <div class="locations-store-finder__choices locations-store-finder__choices--tabs" data-choice-options>
            <label class="locations-store-finder__choice">
              <input type="radio" name="LocationsFinder-state-{{ section.id }}" value="" checked>
              <span>{{ section.settings.all_states_label | default: 'All states' | escape }}</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="locations-store-finder__status" data-location-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

      <div class="locations-store-finder__toolbar">
        <p class="locations-store-finder__count" data-result-count role="status" aria-live="polite">
          {{ all_locations.size }} {% if all_locations.size == 1 %}location{% else %}locations{% endif %}
        </p>
        <div class="locations-store-finder__view-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Choose results view">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-view="list"
            aria-controls="LocationsFinder-list-{{ section.id }}"
            aria-pressed="{% if initial_view == 'list' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
          >
            {{- section.settings.list_view_label | default: 'List' | escape -}}
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-view="map"
            aria-controls="LocationsFinder-map-{{ section.id }}"
            aria-pressed="{% if initial_view == 'map' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
          >
            {{- section.settings.map_view_label | default: 'Map' | escape -}}
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="locations-store-finder__results">
        <div id="LocationsFinder-list-{{ section.id }}" class="locations-store-finder__list-panel" data-list-panel>
          <p class="locations-store-finder__empty" data-no-results hidden>
            {{- section.settings.no_results_text | default: 'No locations match those filters.' | escape -}}
          </p>
          <ul class="locations-store-finder__list" role="list" data-location-list>
            {%- for location in all_locations -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign location_title = location.title.value | default: location.title
                assign location_address = location.storeaddress.value | default: location.storeaddress
                assign location_suburb = location.suburb.value | default: location.suburb
                assign location_state = location.state.value | default: location.state
                capture location_website
                  render 'safe-external-url', url: location.storeaddressurl
                endcapture
                assign location_website = location_website | strip
                assign location_image = location.image.value
                capture directions_destination
                  if location.latitude.value != blank and location.longitude.value != blank
                    echo location.latitude.value | append: ',' | append: location.longitude.value
                  else
                    echo location_address | append: ' ' | append: location_suburb | append: ' ' | append: location_state
                  endif
                endcapture
                assign directions_destination = directions_destination | strip | url_encode
              -%}
              <li
                data-location-card
                data-location-id="{{ location.system.id | escape }}"
                data-location-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
              >
                <article class="locations-store-finder__card" tabindex="-1">
                  {%- if location_image != blank -%}
                    <div class="locations-store-finder__card-image">
                      {{ location_image | image_url: width: 720 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 540, 720', alt: location_image.alt | default: location_title }}
                    </div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <div class="locations-store-finder__card-content">
                    <h3>{{ location_title | escape }}</h3>
                    {%- if location_address != blank or location_suburb != blank or location_state != blank -%}
                      <div class="locations-store-finder__card-row">
                        {%- render 'icon-or-image', icon: 'map_pin', width: 16, class_name: 'locations-store-finder__card-icon' -%}
                        <address>
                          {{ location_address | escape }}
                          {%- if location_suburb != blank or location_state != blank -%}
                            <br>{{ location_suburb | escape }}{% if location_suburb != blank and location_state != blank %}, {% endif %}{{ location_state | escape }}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </address>
                      </div>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {%- if location.time.value != blank -%}
                      <div class="locations-store-finder__card-row">
                        {%- render 'icon-or-image', icon: 'stopwatch', width: 16, class_name: 'locations-store-finder__card-icon' -%}
                        <div class="locations-store-finder__hours rte">{{ location.time | metafield_tag }}</div>
                      </div>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {%- if location.overview.value != blank -%}
                      <div class="locations-store-finder__overview rte">{{ location.overview | metafield_tag }}</div>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {%- if location.tags.value.size > 0 -%}
                      <ul class="locations-store-finder__tags" aria-label="Venue types">
                        {%- for location_tag in location.tags.value -%}
                          <li>{{ location_tag.label.value | default: location_tag.label | escape }}</li>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </ul>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <div class="locations-store-finder__card-actions">
                      {%- if directions_destination != blank -%}
                        <a
                          class="button"
                          data-directions-link
                          href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination={{ directions_destination }}"
                          target="_blank"
                          rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        >
                          {{- section.settings.directions_label | default: 'Directions' | escape -}}
                        </a>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if location_website != blank -%}
                        <a class="button-secondary" data-website-link href="{{ location_website | escape }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                          {{- section.settings.website_label | default: 'Visit website' | escape -}}
                        </a>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <span data-location-distance></span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="LocationsFinder-map-{{ section.id }}" class="locations-store-finder__map-panel" data-map-panel{% unless initial_view == 'map' %} hidden{% endunless %}>
          <div
            class="locations-store-finder__map"
            data-location-map
            role="region"
            aria-label="Store locations map"
          ></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
        <nav class="locations-store-finder__pagination" aria-label="Location result pages" data-fallback-pagination>
          {{ paginate | default_pagination }}
        </nav>
      {%- endif -%}

      <script type="application/json" data-locations-store-finder-data>
        {
          "locations": [
            {%- for location in all_locations -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign location_title = location.title.value | default: location.title
                assign location_address = location.storeaddress.value | default: location.storeaddress
                assign location_suburb = location.suburb.value | default: location.suburb
                assign location_state = location.state.value | default: location.state
                assign location_latitude = location.latitude.value | default: location.latitude
                assign location_longitude = location.longitude.value | default: location.longitude
                assign location_hours = location.time | metafield_tag | strip_html | strip
                assign location_overview = location.overview | metafield_tag | strip_html | strip
                capture location_website
                  render 'safe-external-url', url: location.storeaddressurl
                endcapture
                assign location_website = location_website | strip
                assign location_image = location.image.value
                assign location_image_url = ''
                assign location_image_alt = location_title
                if location_image != blank
                  assign location_image_url = location_image | image_url: width: 900
                  assign location_image_alt = location_image.alt | default: location_title
                endif
              -%}
              {
                "id": {{ location.system.id | json }},
                "title": {{ location_title | json }},
                "address": {{ location_address | json }},
                "suburb": {{ location_suburb | json }},
                "state": {{ location_state | json }},
                "latitude": {% if location_latitude != blank %}{{ location_latitude | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
                "longitude": {% if location_longitude != blank %}{{ location_longitude | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
                "hours": {{ location_hours | json }},
                "overview": {{ location_overview | json }},
                "website": {{ location_website | json }},
                "imageUrl": {{ location_image_url | json }},
                "imageAlt": {{ location_image_alt | json }},
                "tags": [
                  {%- for location_tag in location.tags.value -%}
                    {%- assign location_tag_slug = location_tag.slug.value | default: location_tag.slug | default: location_tag.label.value | handleize -%}
                    {{ location_tag_slug | json }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                ],
                "tagOptions": [
                  {%- for location_tag in location.tags.value -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      assign location_tag_label = location_tag.label.value | default: location_tag.label
                      assign location_tag_slug = location_tag.slug.value | default: location_tag.slug | default: location_tag_label | handleize
                    -%}
                    { "label": {{ location_tag_label | json }}, "slug": {{ location_tag_slug | json }} }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                ]
              }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
            {%- endfor -%}
          ],
          "tags": [
            {%- for tag in all_tags -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign tag_label = tag.label.value | default: tag.label
                assign tag_slug = tag.slug.value | default: tag.slug | default: tag_label | handleize
              -%}
              { "label": {{ tag_label | json }}, "slug": {{ tag_slug | json }} }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
            {%- endfor -%}
          ],
          "settings": {
            "mapsApiKey": {{ maps_api_key | json }},
            "defaultView": {{ section.settings.default_view | default: 'list' | json }},
            "defaultRadius": {{ section.settings.default_radius | default: '50' | json }},
            "paginationErrorStatus": {{ section.settings.pagination_error_status | default: 'Additional locations could not be loaded. Use the result page links to continue browsing.' | json }},
            "noMapKeyStatus": {{ section.settings.no_map_key_status | default: 'Map view is unavailable, but every location remains listed.' | json }},
            "mapErrorStatus": {{ section.settings.map_error_status | default: 'The map could not be loaded. You can still browse every location in the list.' | json }},
            "noCoordinatesStatus": {{ section.settings.no_coordinates_status | default: 'No mapped locations match these filters. Unmapped locations remain in the list.' | json }},
            "geolocationPendingStatus": {{ section.settings.geolocation_pending_status | default: 'Finding your location…' | json }},
            "geolocationSuccessStatus": {{ section.settings.geolocation_success_status | default: 'Showing locations near you.' | json }},
            "geolocationErrorStatus": {{ section.settings.geolocation_error_status | default: 'Your location is unavailable. Search and other filters still work.' | json }}
          }
        }
      </script>
    </div>
  </locations-store-finder>
{%- endpaginate -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .locations-store-finder__editor-notice {
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    max-inline-size: min(100% - 2rem, 60rem);
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #b4551f;
    border-inline-start-width: 4px;
    background: #fdf4ec;
    color: #5c2c0b;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__editor-notice code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder {
    --color: var(--locations-finder-text-color);
    color: var(--locations-finder-text-color);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__inner {
    inline-size: min(100%, var(--locations-finder-content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__heading-group {
    max-inline-size: 62rem;
    margin-block-end: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-h2--size, 3rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__intro {
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__controls {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 11rem), 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__field--search {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__field label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__field input,
  .locations-store-finder__field select {
    min-block-size: 3rem;
    inline-size: 100%;
    padding-inline: 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 28%, transparent);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--locations-finder-card-color);
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__field input:focus-visible,
  .locations-store-finder__field select:focus-visible,
  .locations-store-finder button:focus-visible,
  .locations-store-finder a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__location-button,
  .locations-store-finder__reset-button {
    min-block-size: 3rem;
    padding-inline: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    cursor: pointer;
    /* <button> takes the UA font otherwise: this rendered Arial 13.333px. */
    font: inherit;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__location-button {
    background: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__reset-button {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    justify-self: start;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__status {
    min-block-size: 1.5em;
    margin-block: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__toolbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-block: 1.5rem 1rem;
    padding-block-end: 0.75rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 20%, transparent);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__count {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__view-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    border: 1px solid var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__view-toggle button {
    min-block-size: 2.75rem;
    min-inline-size: 5rem;
    /*
     * A <button> takes the browser's UA font, not its parent's. Without these
     * the List/Map toggle rendered in Arial 13.333px beside a page set in
     * Karla -- measured on the deployed theme, 2026-10-19. Same cause as
     * .variant-select__trigger in snippets/variant-select-styles.liquid.
     */
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: inherit;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__view-toggle button[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    color: #fff;
  }

  /*
   * Venue type renders as pills and state as a tab row, matching production.
   * The radio itself is visually hidden but still focused and operated as
   * normal -- which is why the focus ring is drawn on the label's span, not
   * the input. A fieldset defaults to min-content width, so min-inline-size
   * keeps a long pill row from pushing the page sideways.
   */
  .locations-store-finder__choice-group {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choice-group legend {
    padding: 0;
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choices {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choice {
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choice input {
    position: absolute;
    inline-size: 1px;
    block-size: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choice span {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background-color var(--animation-speed) var(--animation-easing),
      color var(--animation-speed) var(--animation-easing),
      border-color var(--animation-speed) var(--animation-easing);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choice input:focus-visible + span {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choices--pills .locations-store-finder__choice span {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 24%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choices--pills .locations-store-finder__choice input:checked + span {
    background: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    border-color: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choices--tabs {
    gap: 0.25rem 1.25rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choices--tabs .locations-store-finder__choice span {
    padding-block: 0.4rem;
    border-block-end: 2px solid transparent;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__choices--tabs .locations-store-finder__choice input:checked + span {
    border-block-end-color: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    color: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__results {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder[data-active-view='map'] .locations-store-finder__results {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, 0.8fr) minmax(24rem, 1.2fr);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .locations-store-finder[data-active-view='map'] .locations-store-finder__list {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card {
    block-size: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);
    background: var(--locations-finder-card-color);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card-image {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card-image img {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card h3,
  .locations-store-finder__card address,
  .locations-store-finder__card .rte,
  .locations-store-finder__card .rte > :first-child,
  .locations-store-finder__card .rte > :last-child {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card address {
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__tags li {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 24%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /*
   * Address and hours each sit beside their own icon, the way production does
   * it. The icon is decorative -- icon-or-image marks it aria-hidden -- so the
   * address still reads as one string to a screen reader.
   */
  .locations-store-finder__card-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card-icon {
    /* Optical alignment with the first line of text rather than its box. */
    margin-block-start: 0.15em;
    color: var(--locations-finder-accent-color);
    flex: none;
  }

  /*
   * The two actions are real buttons. They were plain inline links, which read
   * as body copy beside the tag pills; production gives the card a filled
   * primary and an outlined secondary. .button and .button-secondary resolve
   * to the theme's own primary/secondary tokens, so these follow the store's
   * button settings instead of carrying their own colours.
   */
  .locations-store-finder__card-actions a {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding-block: 0.55rem;
    padding-inline: 0.9rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__card-actions [data-location-distance] {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__empty {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
  }

  /*
   * Map and list share one height, and the list scrolls inside itself rather
   * than extending the page.
   *
   * Before this, the list rendered all 300 locations in a single uncapped
   * column. Measured on 2026-10-19: the list panel was 96,216px tall, the page
   * 100,203px, which put the flagship section 96,985px down and the footer past
   * 100,000px -- roughly 158 screens of scrolling to reach either. Production
   * caps the same list at 540px with its own scrollbar
   * (sections/ona-store-finder.liquid, .ona-sf__list, scroll height 74,121px
   * inside it) and its whole page measures 3,376px.
   */
  .locations-store-finder {
    --locations-finder-panel-size: 34rem;
    /* List view has no map beside it, so the results get more of the window. */
    --locations-finder-list-size: min(80vh, 56rem);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__map-panel,
  .locations-store-finder__map {
    min-block-size: var(--locations-finder-panel-size);
  }

  /*
   * The results are always a fixed-height scroll region, in both views. List
   * view measured 56,258px before this -- 300 cards in two columns, 89 screens
   * of page -- which also pushed the filters out of reach the moment anyone
   * started scrolling. Map view is capped to the map's height just below.
   */
  .locations-store-finder__list-panel {
    max-block-size: var(--locations-finder-list-size);
    overflow-y: auto;
    /* Reaching the end of the list must not start scrolling the page behind it. */
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    /* Keeps card borders clear of the scrollbar. */
    padding-inline-end: 0.5rem;
  }

  .locations-store-finder[data-active-view='map'] .locations-store-finder__list-panel {
    max-block-size: var(--locations-finder-panel-size);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__map-panel {
    position: sticky;
    inset-block-start: 1rem;
    align-self: start;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--locations-finder-card-color) 82%, currentColor);
  }

  .locations-store-finder__pagination {
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .locations-store-finder__pagination .page,
  .locations-store-finder__pagination .next,
  .locations-store-finder__pagination .prev {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-inline-size: 2.75rem;
    min-block-size: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0.2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 989px) {
    .locations-store-finder__controls {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .locations-store-finder__field--search,
    .locations-store-finder__reset-button {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    /*
     * Map view below 989px: the map goes ABOVE the list, and the list stays on
     * the page. It used to be `display: none`, which meant a visitor whose
     * script had not run -- or had failed -- was left with an empty grey box
     * and no way to reach 250 locations. Production stacks them the same way
     * (sections/ona-store-finder.liquid, max-width:999px). Codex, PR #191.
     */
    .locations-store-finder[data-active-view='map'] .locations-store-finder__results {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .locations-store-finder[data-active-view='map'] .locations-store-finder__map-panel {
      order: 1;
      block-size: min(50vh, 26rem);
      /*
       * Here the results switch from a grid to a flex column, and the panel's
       * `align-self: start` (set for the desktop grid) stops stretching it to the
       * row width and starts sizing it to its content instead -- which, for an
       * empty map container, is 0. Google Maps then renders into a zero-width box
       * and the map is invisible on mobile. Force the full width back.
       */
      inline-size: 100%;
    }

    .locations-store-finder[data-active-view='map'] .locations-store-finder__list-panel {
      order: 2;
      margin-block-start: 1rem;
    }

    .locations-store-finder__map-panel,
    .locations-store-finder__map {
      min-block-size: min(70vh, 38rem);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .locations-store-finder__controls,
    .locations-store-finder__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .locations-store-finder__field--search,
    .locations-store-finder__reset-button {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .locations-store-finder__location-button,
    .locations-store-finder__reset-button {
      inline-size: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .locations-store-finder__view-toggle button,
    .locations-store-finder__card,
    .locations-store-finder__location-button {
      transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
    }

    .locations-store-finder__card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Locations store finder",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Copy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "t:settings.heading", "default": "Find a store" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "intro", "label": "t:settings.description" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "search_label", "label": "Search label", "default": "Search by store, suburb or address" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "search_placeholder", "label": "Search placeholder", "default": "Start typing a location" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "state_label", "label": "State filter label", "default": "State or territory" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "all_states_label", "label": "All states label", "default": "All states" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tag_label", "label": "Venue filter label", "default": "Venue type" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "all_tags_label", "label": "All venues label", "default": "All venues" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "radius_label", "label": "Radius filter label", "default": "Distance" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "use_location_label", "label": "Use location button label", "default": "Use my location" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reset_label", "label": "Reset button label", "default": "Clear filters" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "list_view_label", "label": "List view label", "default": "List" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "map_view_label", "label": "Map view label", "default": "Map" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "directions_label", "label": "Directions link label", "default": "Directions" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "website_label", "label": "Website link label", "default": "Visit website" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "no_results_text", "label": "No results message", "default": "No locations match those filters." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Map and location status" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pagination_error_status", "label": "Additional results error", "default": "Additional locations could not be loaded. Use the result page links to continue browsing." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "no_map_key_status", "label": "Missing map key message", "default": "Map view is unavailable, but every location remains listed." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "map_error_status", "label": "Map error message", "default": "The map could not be loaded. You can still browse every location in the list." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "no_coordinates_status", "label": "No coordinates message", "default": "No mapped locations match these filters. Unmapped locations remain in the list." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "geolocation_pending_status", "label": "Location pending message", "default": "Finding your location…" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "geolocation_success_status", "label": "Location success message", "default": "Showing locations near you." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "geolocation_error_status", "label": "Location error message", "default": "Your location is unavailable. Search and other filters still work." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Map and filters" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "maps_api_key", "label": "Google Maps API key (fallback)", "info": "Leave this empty. The key now lives in Settings > Custom data > Shop > Google Maps API key, which no theme merge or publish can wipe. This field is only a fallback: the theme editor writes it into templates\/page.location.json, which the GitHub integration overwrites, and that silently cost the map twice on 2026-10-19. See docs\/branching-and-release.md section 5." },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "default_view",
      "label": "Default view",
      "info": "Map requires a Google Maps API key. Without one the page serves the list.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "list", "label": "List" },
        { "value": "map", "label": "Map" }
      ],
      "default": "list"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "default_radius",
      "label": "Default radius",
      "options": [
        { "value": "10", "label": "10 km" },
        { "value": "25", "label": "25 km" },
        { "value": "50", "label": "50 km" },
        { "value": "100", "label": "100 km" },
        { "value": "250", "label": "250 km" }
      ],
      "default": "50"
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_state_filter", "label": "Enable state filter", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_tag_filter", "label": "Enable venue filter", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_radius_filter", "label": "Enable radius filter", "default": true },
    { "type": "header", "content": "t:content.layout" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_width",
      "label": "t:settings.width",
      "options": [
        { "value": "narrow", "label": "t:options.narrow" },
        { "value": "normal", "label": "t:options.normal" },
        { "value": "full", "label": "t:options.full" }
      ],
      "default": "full"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "t:content.colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "t:settings.background_color", "default": "#f5f0e8" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "text_color", "label": "t:settings.text_color", "default": "#252525" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent_color", "label": "Accent color", "default": "#6b1835" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "card_background_color", "label": "Card background color", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "t:content.padding" },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
